OL,12,G2300 Bangers & Cash
OL,13,     FMGB GT/Morris Minor Police Car:
OL,14,     FThree MGs from the 70s turn up at
OL,15,     Fthe garage, still covered in
OL,16,     Foriginal factory wax. Nobody can
OL,17,     Fbelieve it, or value them. A
OL,18,     FMorris 1000 turns up at the
OL,19,     Fauction.
